# A colour space outside the bound register.
# expect: ex:image hexplain:RegisterBindingShape sh:SPARQLConstraintComponent
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix hexplain: <https://hexplain.io/ns/core#> .
@prefix acolor: <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/color#> .
@prefix ex:     <https://hexplain.io/test/color-invalid#> .

ex:Scheme a skos:ConceptScheme .
ex:DisplayP3 a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme ex:Scheme .
ex:profile hexplain:usesRegister [ a hexplain:RegisterBinding ; hexplain:forProperty acolor:colorSpace ; hexplain:register ex:Scheme ] .
ex:image acolor:colorSpace ex:Unregistered .
